step	1	-	Quick guide step 1
line	<col=000080>Talk to <col=800000>Larry</col> by the penguin cage in the <col=800000>Ardougne Zoo</col>. (If talking to Larry with all of the items in your inventory, Larry will automatically take you to the iceberg if you select you are ready)</col>
