line	<str>Read the clockwork book.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to your POH and use your Crafting table 3 to turn your steel bar into a clockwork mechanism.</str>
line	
line	<str>Click on the table again and select clockwork toy and then clockwork penguin.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to Ardougne and talk to Larry.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Larry once on the iceberg.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to Ardougne Zoo once again.</str>
line	
line	<str>Unequip both hands and cape slots and use the tuxedo-time option on Larry.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the penguin pen and talk to the penguin. (only one of them has the "talk-to" option)</str>
line	
line	<str>Read the mission report and exit the pen.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Larry to exit the suit.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Larry about the mission report</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Larry in Fred the Farmer's sheep pen in Lumbridge.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the penguins who are disguised as a sheep.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Do the greeting emotes.</col>
