step	49	-	Quick guide step 49
line	<str>Talk to Larry by the penguin cage in the Ardougne Zoo. (If talking to Larry with all of the items in your inventory, Larry will automatically take you to the iceberg if you select you are ready)</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Larry again.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel to the dock north-east of Rellekka and speak to Larry to sail to the Iceberg.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use an oak plank on firm snow patch.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use your spade on, or dig next to, the newly built hut to cover it in snow.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Larry to enter the bird hide and PAY ATTENTION to this cutscene.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Larry.</str>
line	
line	<str>Left-click Travel back to Rellekka using the nearby boat.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Larry on the dock.</str>
line	
line	<str>Read the clockwork book.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to your POH and use your Crafting table 3 to turn your steel bar into a clockwork mechanism.</str>
line	
line	<str>Click on the table again and select clockwork toy and then clockwork penguin.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to Ardougne and talk to Larry.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Larry once on the iceberg.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to Ardougne Zoo once again.</str>
line	
line	<str>Unequip both hands and cape slots and use the tuxedo-time option on Larry.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the penguin pen and talk to the penguin. (only one of them has the "talk-to" option)</str>
line	
line	<str>Read the mission report and exit the pen.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Larry to exit the suit.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Larry about the mission report</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Larry in Fred the Farmer's sheep pen in Lumbridge.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the penguins who are disguised as a sheep.</str>
line	
line	<str>Do the greeting emotes.</str>
line	
line	<str>Exit the penguin suit by talking to Larry.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Larry again so he teleports you to the Zoo.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the tuxedo-time option on Larry.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the penguin pen and talk to penguin. If using Ring of Charos(a), make sure it is equipped. Otherwise, use raw cod on Penguin.</str>
line	
line	<str>Exit the suit by talking to Larry.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Larry again.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go back to Fred the Farmer's sheep pen.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the tuxedo-time option on Larry.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the sheep penguin.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Larry to exit suit.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Fred the Farmer. ( if you have not completed sheep shearer)</str>
line	
line	<str>Get back into the Penguin suit and talk to the Sheep Penguin.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Larry again to get teleported to the iceberg.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Larry once at the iceberg.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the tuxedo-time option on Larry</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to KGP Agent north-west of Larry while in the penguin suit.</str>
line	
line	<str>Do the greeting emotes.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Noodle.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Noodle again to receive the ID card and a mission report.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to KGP Agent.</str>
line	
line	<str>Click on the avalanche.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the first room to the west and talk to KGP Agent.</str>
line	
line	<str>Exit room through the west door and then through the north door.</str>
line	
line	<str>Walk north once outside to the agility course.</str>
